Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.85,HybridFlashback,A,0000,0000,0000,,Immoral weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:05.40,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.16,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,Your Heart Hybrid Gear contains...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:11.33,HybridFlashback,,0000,0000,0000,,...a hidden weapon called \Nan Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.20,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,Once your Hybrid Count goes \Nabove a certain level,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.18,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,you'll probably be able to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.25,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,You should be able to get much\Nstronger than you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:24.03,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:33.93,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Deploying defensive utilities over \Nall of Ataraxia and Megafloat Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.18,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Attention all students.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:40.64,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,This is not a drill or a school event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.21,HybridTop,Si,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.66,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,This is a real battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:45.77,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Show these otherworld invaders \Nwhat you've learned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.84,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll show them all the things \Nwe've been working on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:25.45,Episode,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:25.45,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Climax Hybrid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.25,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy fleet is approaching \NAtaraxia at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:26.20,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifty kilometers until\Nwe're in main gun range.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:29.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sis, why can't I launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:31.78,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.46,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Luck and fighting spirit won't\Nhelp us against those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:41.97,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Your time will come later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:48.19,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu is within range of \Nthe enemy Magitech weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:50.78,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.34,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Your target is the enemy flagship,\Nthe 2000-meter-long battleship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:58.46,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,Destroy it before its main cannon\Ncan target Megafloat Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.86,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:03.40,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You make it sound so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:09.88,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.36,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:56.50,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Don't focus too much on the Magitech weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Thirty kilometers until\Nwe're in enemy battleship range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:03.92,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:07.47,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A Dragorie...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.77,0:04:32.12,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Aine's Hybrid Count is \Nfalling faster than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.12,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,If Chidorigafuchi's Count drops to zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:41.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Ten kilometers until\Nwe're in enemy battleship range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.84,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:45.02,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.72,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,...all I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:55.20,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi, you're overusing\Nyour Absolute Zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can defeat Category-A weapons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:13.87,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm every bit as good as Yurishia and Hayuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:15.25,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're overdoing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.00,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,That took your Hybrid Count \Nall the way down to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:20.08,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,It's below ten percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:22.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.26,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:31.86,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:33.97,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We're in range of the enemy battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:38.03,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.10,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Eros!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.46,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm almost there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.46,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm out of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.32,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Am I supposed to go that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.82,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:34.92,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.27,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.47,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hida-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.37,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Good, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:43.96,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:47.59,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,The tuning room in the Nayuta Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:51.26,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You took a direct hit from the \Nenemy ship, but you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:52.98,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I think you were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.33,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:58.10,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:01.40,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Their cannons have stopped firing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.40,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,but a drop squad of Magitech\Nweapons is landing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.81,0:07:06.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get back out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:08.24,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:13.22,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I can't send you out there, Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:14.28,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.72,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.45,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,My Hybrid Count is under five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:25.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That means I can't even \Nequip my Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:31.63,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:35.79,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let you go out there to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:36.75,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.77,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The Heart Hybrid Gear is all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:45.35,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not allowed to be\Nworse than anyone at using it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:51.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And you're telling me I can't fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:55.53,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,or even equip my Gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.84,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That means I'm worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:02.28,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,There's no reason for me to exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.04,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And there's no reason for me to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:07.89,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.59,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.57,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who I am or where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:17.60,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember my name, \Nmy home, or my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:22.94,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're not surprised, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.04,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.76,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was brought to this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.32,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:33.57,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I spent all my time as a test subject\Nin Dr. Nayuta's research.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.57,0:08:35.98,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember anything\Nbefore being brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:40.50,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And all I remember after that \Nis being a guinea pig here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.20,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:47.02,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,When I try to take an interest in something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:52.25,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I start to wonder if the real me, \Nthe old me, would've cared about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:54.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And once that starts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:56.68,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't bring myself to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:02.26,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Once the combat tests started and I \Ncame to the high school, it got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.10,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You never thought about making friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.62,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid to be around other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:11.82,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Because I never talked to anyone at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:15.70,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm incapable of holding a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:22.20,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But there is one thing I can lean on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.40,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:28.83,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever I got stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.72,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Dr. Nayuta praised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.32,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,She was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was the only one who could use\Nthe Heart Hybrid Gear back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:40.14,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But outside of that,\Nthere was nothing else I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm better than anyone at\Nusing the Heart Hybrid Gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:45.90,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,and I'm stronger than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.14,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:50.65,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't defeat the enemy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.90,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hayuru's defeated 200 enemies. Yurishia, 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:10:00.03,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And I've only defeated thirty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:05.40,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Dr. Nayuta once told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:10.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,...that there's an incredibly powerful\N"Immoral Weapon" inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:14.00,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,When my Hybrid Count goes over its capacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.32,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,it might appear, she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.34,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,My mom said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:21.63,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I told myself that things would work out\Nif I got the Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:27.81,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But how could I get my Hybrid Count\Nabove full when it just kept going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:31.79,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Just when I thought it might \Nbe impossible after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:35.70,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,you appeared, Kizuna Hida.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:39.14,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The man who can break the limits\Non the Hybrid Count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.71,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:45.95,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was filled with hope, and the \Nwhole world seemed different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:52.42,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You felt like a prince that \NDr. Nayuta had sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:54.44,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I told myself I had to make you like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.74,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That I had to make you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:00.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.68,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I looked at everything I \Ncould find in the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A magazine boys read...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:09.33,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...said that they liked it \Nwhen girls made them lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:14.19,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I couldn't cook,\Nso I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:16.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I made a lunch even though \NI didn't know how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.23,0:11:21.28,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And then I read a naughty book for boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:24.32,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,...to find out what would make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:26.79,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you came to \Nwake me up that morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:31.36,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I was actually planning on doing\Nall sorts of things to wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.38,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,B-But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.34,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know what you would do,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and I was scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:44.71,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But I thought it might get you\Nto make a move on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.52,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:51.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't get my Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:55.07,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I was useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.59,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,There was no reason for me to even be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.61,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:05.62,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,with that huge fleet out there,\NAtaraxia might be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's going to die, and it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:08.87,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:11.88,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.46,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Worthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.74,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:18.05,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're just worried nobody's \Ntelling you how great you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:20.34,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't act like you know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:22.56,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,So what if you can't beat someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:25.24,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,So what if some people are better than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.20,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Don't throw a tantrum and put yourself down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.10,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:32.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to be lectured by someone\Nwho doesn't understand a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:32.99,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:36.84,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you think you don't have any talents,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.63,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,and that you're nothing special,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:40.83,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,try to figure out what you can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:43.88,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,and how you can be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.74,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's the kind of outlook you need to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:50.53,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,If you do, you'll find that everyone\Nin this world has a purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:11.12,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,At least deploy your \NAbsolute Zone, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.05,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.23,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:16.05,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:25.20,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,The enemies hit me harder \Nthan I thought they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:28.20,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You dummy! You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.26,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You fool! You useless dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:33.34,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're weak... You don't have any power...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:36.87,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:41.74,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you do that for me,\Nwhen I can't even fight anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:47.09,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,All I can do now is die...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:49.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I helped my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:52.85,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Nayuta Hida, with her research here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:58.86,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But somebody who was better \Nfor the research appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,and I was told I wasn't needed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:10.29,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know anything but the experiments,\Nbut she threw me away anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.41,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,When I went on my own to the Tokyo Float,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:16.06,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,and started going to school, \Nthings were really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:20.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Because I could barely even talk to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.20,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:26.55,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,A person's value isn't \Ndecided by their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:31.72,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,It's decided by how they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:35.50,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,We can always go back and do things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.42,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,We can always start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.52,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I learned then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.31,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:45.82,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.53,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:51.93,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,So let's think together \Nabout how we can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.65,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:58.08,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:01.91,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Do a Heart Hybrid with me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can start over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.84,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's embarrassing,\Nbut I don't mind if it's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:09.65,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:12.72,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Take responsibility, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:14.21,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:28.54,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play with my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:51.55,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:54.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:57.81,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:15.95,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,It worked, Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.79,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna, I want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:25.03,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't had enough yet either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:28.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.79,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,My body feels hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:33.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.51,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's gotten into you, Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.08,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.18,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Shikina-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.44,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a side effect of the Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.64,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,When the Heart Hybrid is successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:47.20,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,the girl is overcome with strong \Nsymptoms that resemble lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.67,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Their libido goes into overdrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:49.29,HybridOverlap,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's a huge nuisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.89,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But if you can use that effect properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.50,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,you can proceed to a higher stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:57.57,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,A higher stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.87,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, a new kind of Hybrid that \Nwill allow for the acquisition...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.43,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,...of Immoral Weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.97,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.94,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Aine, what are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:10.53,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're talking to another woman
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:12.84,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,when you should be having fun with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:16.19,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not true, Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:18.22,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're all I'm thinking about right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:22.07,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:23.73,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:32.28,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:43.16,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:49.36,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It feels so good, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.65,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:03.98,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.78,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,No! At this rate, I'm going to suffocate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.06,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:18.45,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:42.74,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.00,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:54.35,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:55.70,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aine-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:57.49,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:59.01,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.24,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:11.34,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to pay for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:15.25,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Pulverizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:28.26,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.27,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros's new weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:32.19,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Connect!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:41.65,HybridItalics,R,0000,0000,0000,,The Climax Hybrid succeeded, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:44.83,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That is her Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.70,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Now it's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:48.75,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:57.09,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I can buy you time to blast that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.92,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.38,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,That's Eros?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:14.44,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,It seems as fast and powerful as the Zeros!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.09,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:28.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:45.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Enemy battleship has \Ndisappeared from the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:50.60,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy fleet has withdrawn \Nbeyond firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:52.86,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:54.83,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:55.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.52,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you standing out here,\Nlooking so glum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:30.64,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What about you? Did you enjoy the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:34.39,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired after being \Ndragged around everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:36.22,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.50,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:43.99,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I got something else \Nbesides my Immoral Weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.63,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...when I did my Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:48.37,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:50.43,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A fragment of my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.66,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.73,0:21:55.91,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A beautiful lake, and snow-covered peaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.53,0:21:59.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A huge city with tall buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:04.78,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,And a huge, complicated mechanical \Nclock that covered a whole wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:08.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:10.35,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So I want you to do it again—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.35,0:22:12.80,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:15.46,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What are you two doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:18.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,If it isn't the Japanese and American aces,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:20.77,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,who couldn't shoot down a \Nsingle enemy battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:23.89,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hear that from \Nthe first girl to get shot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:25.11,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:26.28,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You were the one who...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:26.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:27.92,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.92,0:22:29.81,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I got in trouble deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:32.57,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to stop them, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.61,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I probably should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:44.05,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Why the sudden call?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.63,0:22:47.01,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Reiri, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.71,0:22:56.56,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,A human?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:23:01.63,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And they're wearing what looks \Nlike a Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:06.45,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,What's a human doing with the \NMagitech weapons from another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:09.73,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Are they from that other world as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:39.98,sign_33686_317_Illustration__Ch,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Choboraunyopomi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.79,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen between Kizuna and Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:31.42,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,It sure looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:34.88,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to go after him hard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:39.98,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,{\fad(900,1)}Next time: Beauty of the Land of Rubble
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:37.87,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,The "Love Room?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:39.09,HybridTop,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
